[[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing nut (1a) and remove the moving tensioner (1b).</p><p>2. Undo the fixing bolts (2a) and remove the moving tensioner support (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002458.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the moving tensioner support.</p><p>Tighten the fixing bolts to the recommended torque;</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Value daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>2.5</p></td><td><p>Bolts</p></td><td><p>MOVING TIMING BELT TENSIONER CAMSHAFT</p></td><td><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the tensioner in the housing and tighten the fixing nut to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Value daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>MOVING TIMING BELT TENSIONER CAMSHAFT</p></td><td><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[4,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the timing belt moving tensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002461.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the timing belt moving tensioner.</p><p>- Screw in the fixing bolt without tightening it to torque.</p>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the timing belt moving tensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179002462.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the timing belt moving tensioner.</p><p>- Screw in the fixing bolt without tightening it to torque.</p>"]]